      "changes": {
        "long_description": {
          "before": "Feldy is field-first AI for home service businesses helping teams capture jobsites, create take-offs & estimates, and documentation.\r\n\r\nFeldy helps teams capture the physical world using photos, videos, AI jobsite walkthroughs, voice notes, and 3D scans using your mobile phone. It turns that field information into takeoffs & estimates, visual designs, and project documentation.\r\n\r\nFeldy is built for roofing, exteriors, remodeling, painting, cleaning, landscaping, tree care, and other home services.\r\n\r\nWe’re building a new way for more than 2 million U.S. home service businesses operating in an $800B+ market to capture, understand, and complete work in the field.\r\n\r\nFeldy is available on iOS, Android, and the web.",
          "after": "Feldy is field-first AI for home service businesses helping teams capture jobsites, create take-offs & estimates, and documentation.\r\n\r\nWith Feldy, teams capture the physical world using photos, videos, AI jobsite walkthroughs, and 3D scans using your mobile phone. It turns field information into takeoffs & estimates, visual designs, and project documentation. Feldy works across home services such as roofing, exteriors, remodeling, painting, cleaning, landscaping, handymen, and other home services.\r\n\r\nWe’re building a new way for more than 2 million U.S. home service businesses operating in an $800B+ market to capture, understand, and complete work in the field.\r\n\r\nFeldy is available on iOS, Android, and the web."
